      "writtenOn": "2015-03-10T21:22:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "a.commonproperties.hostordevicesupported is set by the value passed to InitAndroidModule, and is generally set to HostAndDeviceSupported.  a.hostAndDeviceProperties.DeviceSupported is defaulted to true, and HostSupported is defaulted to false.  Modules can then set hostSupported: true.\n\nBasically, commonProperties.HostOrDeviceSupported is whether or not the module _type_ (ccLibrary) supports one or both, and hostAndDeviceProperties is whether a specific module supports each.\n\nThis got really messy, and is one of the things I\u0027m working on cleaning up.",
      "parentUuid": "b7c5fc25_ee2f1f88",
